      {
        "id": 228874,
        "name": "fenianb",
        "username": "fenianb",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-05-16T14:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here's a transcript of the exchange on yesterday's stream https://youtu.be/PYZuYs-nA64</p>\n<p>**********</p>\n<p>morph147 (via test 5:19) Hi, Maggie, I was wondering if there was any updates on Prime War. Back in Feb, you stated there would be an update in a month or 2 and its been 3 months. Curious if anything has changed</p>\n<p>Maggie (verbally 5:50) Uh, someone just threw in chat, they asked about, they're asking about Prime War. Uh, we're actually currently working on an update, talkign about Prime War. So you'll hear more about it later this month. Um, so yeah, just stay tuned sometime later this month hopefully. I mean it'll definitely be within this month, you'll hear about it.</p>\n<p>{missing in text replay but I did see it live - morph147 asked about passing this info on to the forum}</p>\n<p>Greater Than Games (text 7:31) #morph147 yes, please feel free to let them know that we will have on update later this month :) And thank you for your question</p>\n<p>**********</p>\n<p>So hopefully no definitely within this month, but not stated if that's within the month of May or by June 15th a month from her statement. We'll see.</p>",
