        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-05-17T23:31:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm tempted to start a This Day In Prime War History thread. One year ago today Paul Bender said \"Lore Forge was in town this week and we made a ton of progress on the rules and playtesting! At this point, you'll see a very close to final version of the Prime War rules at Gen Con with very preliminary art and graphic design. We are currently planning on having the game ready to send to the printer in Q1 2020.\"&nbsp;https://greaterthangames.com/comment/201987#comment-201987 So maybe the coming announcement will thrill us all. :)</p>",
        "post_number": 76,
