        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-05-29T22:12:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"fenianb\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fenianb:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So hopefully no definitely within this month, but not stated if that’s within the month of May or by June 15th a month from her statement. We’ll see.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Unless someone is working this weekend I guess within the month of May is out. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
