        "id": 228882,
        "name": "fenianb",
        "username": "fenianb",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-06-01T16:01:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wish I could say I was surprised but as time passed since Maggie swang by to say an announcement was coming I started expecting at best further delays. It doesn't take months to say 'we're going to press!' At least the band-aid is finally ripped off what I think should probably have been shut down long ago.</p>",
