      {
        "id": 228883,
        "name": "Estelindis",
        "username": "Estelindis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/estelindis/{size}/2017_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-06-01T17:49:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On the one hand, they had our money for five years, and we are getting no product.&nbsp; On the other hand, they are giving full refunds, and it's clear that they put plenty of work into a project for which, in the end, they are getting no revenue.&nbsp; I'm sure, as unfortunate as this is for us loyal original pre-orderers, it's a much sadder day for GtG.&nbsp; Probably for the best, though, based on what they are saying.</p>",
